COMPILATION OF: E46L12

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L12 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 7, AUTO STORAGE 21 BYTES
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 V CHAR(20) VARYING AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L12

   1 a 0000 E46L12:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2a] runtime 1: the CHARACTER VARYING item actually REACHES THE FILE.  The
   4 a 0006      lowering is E46L1's; what this object adds is a real length in the cell.  Written under
   5 a 0006      the LITERAL title 'L12OUT DAT', so by [C279]'s measurement of E16D the CP/M name is
   6 a 0006      `L12OUT' with NO extension. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying;
   8 c 0006   v = 'HELLO';
   9 c 0013   open file(outf) stream output title('L12OUT DAT');
  10 c 0030   put file(outf) list(v);
  11 c 0048   close file(outf);
  12 c 004E   put list('DONE');
  13 c 0065   stop;
  14 a 0068 end E46L12;

CODE SIZE = 0068
DATA AREA = 0028
FREE SYMS = 386B
END  COMPILATION
